{"availability":"available","full":"aurorascharff/next16-mail","name":"next16-mail","description":"A Gmail-style mail client demo exploring Cache Components, Partial Prefetching, and the navigation() API with Next.js 16.4, React 19, Tailwind CSS v4, and Prisma.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":3,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-28T16:59:47Z","updated":"2026-09-29T09:05:08Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://next16-mail.vercel.app","topics":["app-router","async-react","cache-components","email","nextjs","optimistic-ui","partial-prefetching","prisma","react19","rsc","server-actions","suspense","tailwindcss-v4","view-transitions"],"demo":"https://next16-mail.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:51.262Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:51.262Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:51.262Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T05:41:51.262Z","stars":3,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A Gmail-style mail client that demonstrates Instant Navigations in Next.js 16.4, including the new navigation() API.","The architecture follows the Next.js App Architecture skill and the Component Architecture for React Server Components blog post."],"features":["Cache Components cache each query with 'use cache', name the data with cacheTag, and set its lifetime with cacheLife. The signed-in account is read with 'use cache: private' and passed into each cached query.","Partial Prefetching prefetches one shared App Shell per route. Mailbox links, pager links, and the thread rows in view use prefetch={true}, which also resolves each thread's header. Labels in the sidebar prefetch on…","navigation() is awaited in the message components before they query, which keeps message bodies out of every prefetch while their cached results still serve later visits.","Server Functions star, archive, mark read, reply, compose, and undo a send on the server, and invalidate only the tags they change with updateTag. New text is screened through the Vercel AI Gateway.","React Compiler memoizes components and hooks automatically, so the code needs no manual useMemo or useCallback."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aurorascharff/next16-mail/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"91df2d05d35bea41b294dcc822a622e2e6c81c8a48d0a3b7036bcf0f695eecdc","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:51.380Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:51.380Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A Gmail-style mail client that demonstrates Instant Navigations in Next.js 16.4, including the new navigation() API.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aurorascharff/next16-mail/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"91df2d05d35bea41b294dcc822a622e2e6c81c8a48d0a3b7036bcf0f695eecdc","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aurorascharff/next16-mail/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:51.380Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-29T09:05:08Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aurorascharff/next16-mail/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:51.381Z","hash":"91df2d05d35bea41b294dcc822a622e2e6c81c8a48d0a3b7036bcf0f695eecdc","originalBytes":6325,"storedBytes":6325,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["cache","pnpm","navigation","run","thread","message","mailbox","per","prefetch","account","cached","components","one","postgres","react","server","they","after","app","before","database","each","next","next.js","prisma","read","sqlite","url","against","architecture","bash","data","header","latest","links","locally","messages","new","playwright","production","reply","seed","through","view","work","arrives","below","bodies","compiler","dev","earlier","end-to-end","follows","form","functions","gateway","how","instant","keeps","labels","license","mail","newest","only","page","pager","partial","postgresql","prefetching","query","row","rows","set","shell","sidebar","stamp","suspense","tests","toolbar",